@function[(char* scheme_utf8_encode_to_buffer_len
           [const-mzchar* s]
           [int len]
           [char* buf]
           [int blen]
           [intptr_t* rlen])]{

Like @cpp{scheme_utf8_encode_to_buffer}, but the length of the
 resulting encoding (not including a nul terminator) is reported in
