@note-lib-only[racket/syntax-srcloc]

@defproc[(syntax-srcloc [stx syntax?]) (or/c #f srcloc?)]{

Returns the @tech{source location} for the @tech{syntax object}
@racket[stx], or @racket[#f] if none is known.

